Toolbox: galois_fields

Title: Galois Fields

Summary: Arithmetic in finite fields GF(p) and GF(p^n) and on polynomials over GF(p)

Version: 2.0.0

Author: Daniel E Rodriguez

Maintainer: Daniel E Rodriguez

Category: Mathematics

Entity: Universidad Industrial de Santander (UIS)

License: CeCILL

ScilabVersion: >= 6.1

Depends:

Date: 2026-10-10

Description: Builds finite fields from primitive polynomials and provides
 element arithmetic (add, subtract, multiply, divide, power), arithmetic on
 polynomials over GF(p), primitive and minimal polynomials, primitive
 elements, operation tables and conversion between polynomial and
 exponential notation. Successor of the campos_finitos toolbox.
